{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And a spirit. For him who sits in judgment.</b> These are the Sanhedrin, and the meaning is that He will sustain them." "<b>Who turn back the battle [to the gate].</b> To the gate. Some say: its return from the gate, and R. Moses the Cohen said that HaShem will strengthen the fugitives, and this is the correct interpretation."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:55:30.726972698Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}